note Absolute max of one bf16 row, window 128. The sign bit is cleared before
note the widen, matching the quantize scan. A non-finite value (not <= 3.0e38f)
note returns 2 and does not commit this row. 3.0e38f bits 2137108966.
note WolframLanguageEvaluator: FromDigits of the Real32 bit list of 3.0*^38 -> 2137108966.
fn av_fp8am n ulong w view ushort 128 acc edit f32 1 to ulong
if gt n 128
ret 1
end
a = get acc 0
for i ulong 128
if lt i n
u = shl and uint get w i 32767 16
f = bitcast f32 u
if not le f bitcast f32 uint 2137108966
ret 2
end
if gt f a
a = f
end
end
end
put acc 0 a
ret 0
end
